---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About" breadcrumb="About & Contributors">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="label">About</div>
    <h1>About NPCollab</h1>
    <p>A free, collaborative clinical resource built by Australian Nurse Practitioners, for Australian Nurse Practitioners.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="content-prose">
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>NPCollab exists to provide free, high-quality, evidence-based clinical learning resources for Australian Nurse Practitioners — whether you are just starting out in your NP career, completing your Master's degree, or looking for a quick clinical reference.</p>
    <p>Every resource on NPCollab is:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Free</strong> — no paywalls, no subscriptions, no advertising</li>
      <li><strong>Australian-contextualised</strong> — AHPRA-aligned, uses Australian guidelines (TG, NMBA, RACGP)</li>
      <li><strong>Clinically grounded</strong> — written and reviewed by practising NPs</li>
      <li><strong>Open to contribution</strong> — via GitHub for those who want to add or improve content</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="highlight-box">
      <h4>Important Disclaimer</h4>
      <p>All content on NPCollab is for <strong>educational purposes only</strong>. It does not constitute clinical advice. Always apply your own clinical judgement, refer to current Australian guidelines, and consult with colleagues when managing complex presentations. NPCollab is not a substitute for formal clinical supervision, employer credentialing requirements, or the NMBA Standards for Practice.</p>
    </div>
    <h2>Contributors</h2>
    <p>NPCollab is maintained by a small team of practising Australian Nurse Practitioners who contribute in their own time.</p>
    <div class="contributors-grid">
      <div class="contributor-card">
        <div class="contributor-avatar">🩺</div>
        <h4>Founding Contributor</h4>
        <div class="role">Nurse Practitioner</div>
        <p>Creator and lead content developer for NPCollab</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contributor-card">
        <div class="contributor-avatar">➕</div>
        <h4>You?</h4>
        <div class="role">Open Contribution</div>
        <p>We welcome NP contributors. See our GitHub repository to get involved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2>How to Contribute</h2>
    <p>NPCollab is built on GitHub. Content is stored as Markdown files — if you can write a Word document, you can contribute to NPCollab. You do not need to know how to code.</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Visit the NPCollab GitHub repository</li>
      <li>Open the relevant content file (e.g. <code>src/content/modules/ent/index.md</code>)</li>
      <li>Click the pencil (edit) icon</li>
      <li>Make your changes and submit a pull request with a brief description</li>
      <li>The site maintainer will review and merge approved contributions</li>
    </ol>
    <div class="info-box">
      <p>📬 <strong>Want to contribute a new module?</strong> Raise an issue on GitHub describing the module you would like to add and we will set up the template structure for you.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
